# ICE RIOT build-context filter. Patterns are relative to the REPO ROOT (the build context).
#
# Docker reads .dockerignore from the root of the build context, or (BuildKit) from
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile. With context = repo root, put this
# file at ./.dockerignore or deploy/Dockerfile.dockerignore to make it take effect.
# It only shrinks the upload: deploy/Dockerfile COPYs package.json, server/, shared/ and
# public/ explicitly, so nothing else can end up in the image either way.

# Exclude everything ...
*

# ... except what the image needs.
!package.json
!server
!shared
!public

# Junk that may live inside those folders.
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log
**/.env
